# Barreletics Design System — section library (HARD)

Reusable Shopify **section library**, not a homepage. Brian (or later) assembles templates after sections freeze in repo.

## Contract (authority)

- **Frozen inventory:** `planning/m4-section-library-CONTRACT.md` (ARCHITECTURE APPROVED 2026-07-26)
- Proposal history only: `planning/m4-section-library-architecture.md` (superseded)
- Final theme = **only** the approved production library — replace legacy; no duplicate generations

## Delivery

- Repo only: `shopify-build/` from locked HTML mocks → GitHub → Brian
- **No agent Shopify push** by default (`shopify-draft-theme-only.mdc`)

## Locked decisions (abbrev)

| Rule | Detail |
|------|--------|
| Heroes | **No artificial hero cap** — build distinct capabilities only (`split-hero`, `hero-fullbleed`, `collection-split`, …) |
| Naming | `home-split-hero` → **`split-hero`**; collection entry → **`collection-split`** |
| Companions | **`sole-cards`** = own reusable section (not permanently coupled to `collection-split`) |
| Statement | **`statement-band`** standalone; full-bleed commit/lifestyle = separate sections |
| PDP | **`pdp-features` kept** — do not merge into `fifty-fifty` |
| Reviews | One **`reviews`** section |
| GEO | Inside **`studio-trust`** |
| Newsletter | Footer **and** standalone `newsletter` |
| Campaign | `campaign-stage` **deferred** |
| variant-grid | KEEP logic non-negotiable |

## Workflow

1. Acknowledge CONTRACT before production code  
2. Build **ONE** section → QA → Andrew approve → freeze in repo → next  
3. **First after contract:** `split-hero` only (rebuild/rename from `home-split-hero`) until frozen  
4. Blocked until that freeze: every other new/rebuild marketing section  

## Architecture (every major component)

| Requirement | Rule |
|-------------|------|
| File | Own `sections/*.liquid` |
| Schema | Complete + `presets` |
| Editor | Independently draggable / removable / reusable |
| Shared | `snippets/` + shared assets only |
| Coupling | No section depends on another |
| Scope | No monolithic `page-*` long-term |

## Anti-patterns

- Multiple new sections in one pass  
- Homepage-only Liquid/CSS  
- Sibling-section hard dependencies  
- Monolithic page sections  
- Building past `split-hero` before it is frozen  
- Assembling pages on Shopify instead of freezing in repo  

